    <guid isPermaLink="false">67911feaa2c8d144a7dd58e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jan 2025 18:16:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>2025年的第一集播客献给那些治愈我无数次的韩剧们！</span></strong><span>（期待国产剧能慢慢赶超：）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期将提到</span></strong><span>：</span><em><span>《太阳的后裔》《眼泪女王》《二十五二十一》《举重妖精金福珠》《机智的医生生活》（以及一长串对于演员柳演锡&amp;田美都的安利）</span></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 사랑이란 (When You're In Love), （정문성/田美都）音乐剧《也许是幸福的结局》 (Maybe Happy Ending (Korean Cast Recording))</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> &nbsp;为什么说小红书式鸡汤教学泛滥成灾并不是好事？Supporting system支持系统是啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 看着我长大的韩剧《太阳的后裔》？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 演员演技颜值cp感很好败在情节的《眼泪女王》！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 冬日小甜剧《举重妖精金福珠》？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a> 我的人生角色罗希度&amp;南柱赫颜值高光诞生剧《二十五二十一》？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1314">21:54</a> 我的人生韩剧《机智的医生生活》！！！我超爱的安政源（柳演锡）&amp;蔡颂和（田美都）！！！！！！！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGnycpP99A8Q8nAseN4BHLgABsE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 详细安利一下wuli美都欧尼&amp;丁文昇（其实是‘都在学医生’）的Maybe Happy Ending</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqzb-ScDuA8iJSKqny_nmnIMtOcV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl-rThfogkqqMXqTaG4ok37CwyhR.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIg47oywfbLCMB3AGisL9-v7q_T.png"></figure>]]></description>
