    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><em><strong><span>她是浩瀚宇宙中的飞船，沉寂多年的对讲机里，他是唯一的应答</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><h2><span>前情提要：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>看电影看剧的本质都是去看、享受一个由演员、作者、编剧、导演一起创造和诉说的故事。看八月长安的小说，有很强的实感，里面不仅有所谓‘心动的懵懂’，有家庭关系的矛盾，人际关系的不合，那些对于青春憧憬过、拥有过、逝去着、失去了的细腻感受。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>很喜欢的场景</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjHeg6yKDJO26X9Uw71J7tfvCcA3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjk6PdK6WLrtIpmgSJQUEiLoC-e1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FshfnU2Mxbj4RUv-La9HXPAy6TsC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（特别喜欢这个西餐厅的氛围）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSmYvelufdTn5wvZpnlfeuQHyZI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnkuumvqvACHHEKXWqMJEjTMctm1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjqeiyiwTmUqHxdDIRmdMWLhomee.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>很喜欢的拥抱</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmH1vPWUXlA_41nQ38tiAlm24Sof.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>很喜欢的落泪</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flzo_4lT-Yh6SqauK_S5854zCwOD.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>令人鼻头一酸的细节</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkXAmrgo83UJk0jg3KjpvB0WrtNm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkq1ogp05bHOQmftQNkWJZ55ZNRF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqIrSaKbE78o8Q7M7DQRtvDwZcEh.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqa0_Pb12Bn5iB_6Lr6U6cg9sN1G.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（观察小女孩和小男孩的表情）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2PI1uT5oc2m-1Tp5yU9zCMbyZn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（容不下的牙刷）</span></p>]]></description>
